      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
      "body": "Tracks standardizing the settings around using the VS Code file watcher. Currently we use the setting `typescript.tsserver.experimental.useVsCodeWatcher`\n\nI proposed making this instead live under `typescript.tsserver.watchOptions` since none of those other watch options apply for the VS Code watcher\n\nWe'll keep observing `typescript.tsserver.experimental.useVsCodeWatcher` for a few iterations but add a deprecated message.",
